SUMMARY:Winter Open House
DESCRIPTION:A Winter Wonderland for your porch\, patio and planters! Wander through a greenhouse filled with evergreens\, winter berries\, sparkling accents\, natural elements and festive outdoor décor—all curated to help you create beautiful containers that last all season. From evergreens and logs to sparkling baubles and glittering pinecones\, enjoy our huge selection of outdoor-grade accents curated for their long-lasting performance in container gardens. Discover the magic of winter container gardens that bring beauty and warmth all season long. Event Highlights Include: Hot Cocoa & Cookies Cozy up with a warm cup of hot cocoa and enjoy a delicious variety of cookies to sweeten your visit. Everyone Wins a Prize Spin the wheel at checkout for guaranteed prizes and seasonal surprises! \n\n\n\n Winter Potting Workshop at 11 AM Winter Trends Tour at 2 PM Drop Off Your Pot Service Custom Wreath Orders Get your home or business ready for the season of celebrations and gatherings with Perfect Pots. Celebrate the season and refresh your outdoor spaces with us—we can’t wait to see you there! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/winter-open-house/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
