SUMMARY:Winter Garden Trends Tour
DESCRIPTION:Discover Winter Magic with Our Trends Tour! \n\nCalling all DIY enthusiasts! Join us for the 2026 Winter Garden Trends Tour and uncover the secrets to stunning winter container gardens. With over 17 years of experience\, a Perfect Pots expert designer will walk you through the top trends in winter garden designs. From glittering glam to rustic charm\, learn the expert techniques behind how we transform evergreens\, outdoor-grade accents\, logs\, lighted twigs and more into show-stopping arrangements that last all winter.\n\nLooking for design inspiration\, pro advice\, or easy-to-follow recipes for your own winter wonderland? This tour is perfect for sparking your creativity and bringing festive cheer to your doorstep\, patio\, or storefront.\n\nEnjoy complimentary hot cocoa and cookies as you soak up ideas and leave ready to make your outdoor spaces shine! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/winter-garden-trends-tour/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
