SUMMARY:Paper Snowflake Crafternoon
DESCRIPTION:Have you long been obsessed with the beautiful paper snowflakes made from old books that adorn our store every holiday season? Have you dreamed of making your own? Now’s your chance! Local artist Melina Yingling-Enterline is hosting a workshop at Pocket Books in which you’ll learn to make your own bookish snowflake! Take your snowflake home & then make a whole blizzard of gorgeous\, sparkly friends for it — you’ll be on your way to a Little Women-style homespun holiday in no time!  \n\n\n\n$30 ticket required\, and spots are limited\, so reserve your spot soon! Kids under the age of 13 are welcome with an adult to supervise. Happy crafting! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
