SUMMARY:Tellus AfterDark: Cuffing Season
DESCRIPTION:The nights are getting colder\, and nobody wants to spend another winter swiping. Tellus AfterDark is back. Here’s the deal: A host checks you in and hands you a name tag. You start at small tables with a game that does the flirting-opener for you\, so nobody has to break the ice alone. Then the room opens up and it’s on you. Grab a drink on your own tab\, find the person you were eyeing across the table\, and see where it goes. Come solo or bring your wingwoman. Everyone in the room came out for the same reason you did. 21+. Your winter plans start here. How the night works. You check in with a host and get a name tag — there’s nothing to download and no profile to fill out at the door. The evening runs in three movements. First\, you’re seated at a small table with a game to play — that’s the icebreaker\, so nobody has to invent an opening line cold — and the men move one table along each round\, which means every round is a genuinely new set of people. Then the structure drops away and it’s open mingling: go where you want\, talk to whoever you want\, for as long as it’s working. By that point you’ve already met most of the room\, so nobody is starting cold — which is the part a bar full of strangers never gets right. Last\, one-on-ones with the people you haven’t already sat with. Near the end you privately note anyone you’d like to see again\, and nobody else sees it. If someone noted you back\, that’s a match\, and you both get it that night rather than after some review period. Why it’s built this way. Everyone in the room came out on purpose on a Wednesday night. That’s a filter no dating app has. The structure does the hard part — you never have to work out how to start or end a conversation — and the other awkward part\, finding out whether it was mutual\, is handled quietly for you afterwards. \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/tellus-afterdark-cuffing-season/
LOCATION:Tellus360\, 24 East King Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/quiet-16x9-1.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="SparkDate":MAILTO:taylor.ancapital@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
