SUMMARY:Extra Give @ Pocket Books
DESCRIPTION:We love to give back to our wonderful community\, and we especially love collaborating with the organizations doing excellent\, important work all year long. This year for the Extra Give\, Pocket Books is partnering with three different organizations\, and will split a portion of all sales on 11/20 (at both locations! and online!) with the orgs!!!  \n\n\n\nLANCASTER COUNTY CHOOSES LOVE will have a table at our Prince Street location\, giving out info about the variety of services they provide for the queer community! \n\n\n\n PLANNED PARENTHOOD KEYSTONE will have a table at our Wheatland location from 3-6pm\, providing info about the wide variety of services and healthcare they provide!  \n\n\n\nTHE LANCASTER NEIGHBOR FUND will have table at our Wheatland location from 6-8pm\, providing snacks & info about their essential work! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/extra-give-pocket-books/
