SUMMARY:2026 #ExtraGive Happy Hour at Decades Featuring 12 Nonprofit Organizations
DESCRIPTION:Decades is excited to once again host an #ExtraGive Happy Hour on Friday\, November 20\, 2026\, from 4pm to 6pm featuring 12 nonprofit organizations! The happy hour is open to the public. No ticket needed. All ages welcome! \n\n\n\nNonprofit Lineup \n\n\n\nWe are excited to host 12 nonprofits at Decades including: \n\n\n\n\nArch Street Center\n\n\n\nAmerican Heart Association\n\n\n\nBig Brothers Big Sisters\n\n\n\nDiscovering Paths Mentoring Program with the Lancaster Chamber\n\n\n\nEphrata Performing Arts Center\n\n\n\nLancaster Public Library\n\n\n\nLancaster Farm Sanctuary\n\n\n\nMilagro House\n\n\n\nMental Health America\n\n\n\nWriteFace\n\n\n\nWalk To End Alzheimer’s – Alzheimer’s Association\n\n\n\nThe YMCA\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/2026-extragive-happy-hour-at-decades-featuring-12-nonprofit-organizations/
LOCATION:Decades Lancaster\, 438 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
