SUMMARY:ExtraGive Junior
DESCRIPTION:Why should adults have all the fun during the ExtraGive? Help us celebrate the Lancaster County Community Foundation’s annual Extraordinary Give with a fun event designed for kids of all ages!\n\nOur young guests will experience a variety of free entertainment and creative table activities developed just for them by community benefit organizations\, including:\n\n• Church World Service\n• Imani Edu-tainers\n• Lancaster Shakespeare Theatre\n• Lone Oak Animal Assisted Therapeutic Services\n• Music for Everyone\n• New School Montessori\n• Pennsylvania Dutch Council\, Scouting America\n• SWAN\n• Touchstone Foundation\n\n…and more!\n\nPlus\, a puppetry workshop from the performers of Grand Pistachio (including a sneak peek at their show Layer the Walls) at 6:30 pm!\n\nImmerse your kids in the joy of giving back! This is a free event\, and all are welcome. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/extragive-junior-2/
