SUMMARY:Illumination
DESCRIPTION:Experience Lancaster’s original candlelit concert where candlelight\, harmony\, and the beauty of the holiday season surrounds you. This intimate experience returns newly imagined — beloved songs reborn in-the-round by radiant performers and rich live music. Every seat is wrapped in warmth and wonder\, offering moments of peace and a welcome rise of joy in the midst of the season’s rush. Immerse yourself in this soul-stirring concert that reminds us of what still feels sacred and leaves you carrying a little more light with you. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
